  "document": "Wish Upon\nWish Upon is a 2017 American supernatural horror film directed by John R. Leonetti, written by Barbara Marshall and starring Joey King, Ki Hong Lee, Sydney Park, Elisabeth Rohm, and Ryan Phillippe. The film follows a teenage girl who finds a magic box that grants wishes but kills someone close to her each time."
